<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-29T10:16:28.272Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:16:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopia has received 12 Russian Su-35 fighter jets and announced plans to acquire S-400 air defence systems while clashes have forced up to 50,000 people to flee across the Kenya border into Moyale County. Armed attackers killed at least 60 Orthodox Christians in Oromia and a drone strike killed two government civil servants in western Oromia. Senior Tigray Military Commander Major General Yohannes was captured near the Eritrean border. The UCDP recorded 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw78prj801pvo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQSl9RZXktMzNjWWNNLUtNT1AySlhCNTltZ1ktWENhQVFWaVd3aGdDMkRZVFgzZktHWHp3Z0RKcENRb3NueEs0UHZRcS1yTmVlZTRrNndOSEhTRHBEVGJnQmc5WS1zMnQ5Ymx0VVRGNVpnR25oWG5UaVR6MTA1WXVoZXlQNEQ0WWdOeHB6eGhBSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQNXlaWVRvRWViV2N1R0c0OFFBZ2VFZmRmN0pMRDdSbUQtYnhyb0wyYWdXZ1EwMmUtSVJuRnVqRXQwV01MMGhTb1NjckthLXN1UkxHUnUzQzY4SkdFY1VmOHFuR05ESmlIYjhKMTVlLVhER0Uxallrelh2cXFiX2FicjQ4aG5JeU5XSnpacDc1QjNDdlhsbXRlQi0xbHpnRlhhTFJ0WHlSU1VuZWU2b09FLU9vWmJIbnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxONl9zRnRCRFNWY2owRWwyY2N3bVVBWHNkdUdUYWN5ZGx2QVlPY19jV09aZTg4U0tJUlkydmFjMGVpQWRBQU1BNGd2aEktM1BUZk5iRWJPMkZKR3BpcVQwWWhfVDBZUFhkcTFndldYa2xaTGNVSFpmOEFuclo0bWYydUR5em1wdW9mQ2o0TFVISUZsZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPMkViTWdJQUpxZm9UMW5LeUdMRm5NN2hqTjRabFluVFpDQ2JVcXI1eEd5Z2FVcmFBX0RLaGkxT2N4NVNxWGM0TE1SejlHbWVXUzN